<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    @* Preload the above-the-fold brand faces — Inter (body) + Barlow Condensed
       (display). Paired with font-display: optional in app.css: optional
       guarantees no post-paint font swap (→ zero CLS; see the 2026-07 perf
       baseline — font swap was the sole layout-shift culprit), and preloading
       the first-paint-critical weights lets the brand fonts win optional's
       short block period so they still render on first paint. JetBrains Mono
       (code) and Roboto (secondary fallback) are deliberately not preloaded —
       they are not above the fold, and over-preloading steals bandwidth from
       the critical faces. crossorigin is required: fonts fetch in CORS mode
       even same-origin, and the preload must match that to dedupe with the
       CSS-triggered request. *@
    <link rel="preload" href="fonts/inter/inter-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="fonts/inter/inter-latin-500-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="fonts/barlow-condensed/barlow-condensed-latin-500-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link rel="preload" href="fonts/barlow-condensed/barlow-condensed-latin-700-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <link href="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css" />
    @* Scoped-CSS bundle (every Components/**/*.razor.css). Without this link
       none of the per-component styles ship — see ScopedCssBundleTests. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="PinballWizard.Web.styles.css" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <script>
        (function () {
            try {
                var t = localStorage.getItem('pinwiz.theme') || 'paper';
                if (t !== 'modern-lcd') document.documentElement.classList.add('theme-' + t);
                var m = localStorage.getItem('pinwiz.motion');
                if (m) document.documentElement.dataset.motion = m;
                if (localStorage.getItem('pinwiz.admin.nav.collapsed') === 'true')
                    document.documentElement.classList.add('pw-admin-nav--collapsed');
            } catch (_) { }
        })();
    </script>
    <script src="app.js"></script>
    @* Admin sidebar collapse toggle (spec §5.1). External file → no CSP hash needed.
       Toggles the pw-admin-nav--collapsed class only; width is CSS-driven (app.css). *@
    <script src="js/admin-nav-collapse.js"></script>
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
    <script src="_content/MudBlazor/MudBlazor.min.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
